    "causal_summary": "Completely refactor the sk-code-mobile-cli surface skill so it teaches the SvelteKit 5 / Svelte 5 stack instead of React — SMART ROUTING + surface-detection markers, the @ds grammar's .svelte seam form, the per-component scoped <style> model, the Bits UI / Melt UI mapping, runes verification, and setup/standards. It is the conventions authority every cli-devin dispatch loads, so it drafts before the first code dispatch and finalizes at cutover. The skill lives in the Public monorepo (symlinked); it lands via an isolated Public worktree.",
